> What is an extinctionist?

When 120 monsters of a given kind have been generated, usually no more are
randomly generated (some monsters have a lower limit). If you kill 120 of
*all* monsters, you've made all species "extinct", and you're called an
"extinctionist". It takes ages, and hence needs a lot of patience...

> What is the hand of Elbereth?

Whe you pray a lot, eventually you will be crowned. That means that you
get a few intrinsics (cold resistance, fire resistance, and a few more),
your prayer timeout gets about doubled on average (so you can pray less
often), and you're given a title (Glory of Arioch for chaotics, Envoy of
Balance for neutrals, and, you guessed it, Hand of Elbereth for lawfuls).

